[215.71886, "o", "3. **Observed Entry Mechanism**: Forensic artifacts in CTI intelligence (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`) and registry baseline (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg`) confirm that the entry vector was RDP credential brute-forcing (`T1110`) resulting from Network Level Authentication (NLA) being disabled (`UserAuthentication = 0`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
