[250.053647, "o", "> 1. **Network Firewall Block**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[250.054963, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Add inbound drop rule for `198.51.100.92` on perimeter firewall and host Windows Firewall (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Verification**: Run `Test-NetConnection -ComputerName 198.51.100.92` to confirm zero outbound/inbound connectivity.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **RDP Exposure Mitigation**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Modify registry key `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Terminal Server\\WinStations\\RDP-Tcp` setting `UserAuthentication = 1` (enable NLA) (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Verification**: Query registry via `reg query \"HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Terminal Server\\WinStations\\RDP-Tcp\" /v UserAuthentication` and verify output is `0x1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 2: Persistence Quarantine & Remediation (High Priority)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Process & Binary Quarantine**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Terminate process `svc.exe`. Move `/Users/Public/svc.exe` to isolated quarantine directory `C:\\Quarantine\\` with access control restrictions (`/disk/Users/Public/svc.exe`). Do not delete directly.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[250.055073, "o", "   - **Verification**: Confirm process is absent in Task Manager / `Get-Process svc` and file moved to `C:\\Quarantine\\`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[250.055124, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[250.055829, "o", "> 2. **Scheduled Task Removal**:"]
[250.055847, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Delete scheduled task `UpdateHelper` via `schtasks /Delete /TN \"UpdateHelper\" /F` (`/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Verification**: Run `schtasks /Query /TN \"UpdateHelper\"` and confirm task not found.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. **Malicious Driver Service Remediation**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - **Action**: Stop service `svc-helper` (`sc stop svc-helper`), set startup type to disabled (`sc config svc-helper start= disabled`), and move `/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys` to `C:\\Quarantine\\` (`/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys`). Delete service definition via `sc delete svc-helper`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[250.056067, "o", "   - **Verification**: Run `sc query svc-helper` to confirm service does not exist."]
[250.056133, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[250.056226, "o", "> 4. **Silent Registry Run Key Removal**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
